+## 7. Sharp-Chau
+
+Under the MF-EXACT hypotheses, the generic pencil curve `C_L` has degree
+`D_F=max(deg P,deg Q)`. A degree-`D_F` plane curve has at most `D_F` places at
+infinity. But the source-infinity bookkeeping above gives
